implement/references/ui-build/page-craft.md adapts rules from three sources.
All text is paraphrased, merged and reorganised; none is copied verbatim.

1. taste-skill by Leon Lin (MIT)
   Upstream-Repo: https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
   Upstream-Path: skills/taste-skill (commits 3c7017d to 9b7d575)
   Used: page composition, contrast, motion safety, content honesty, theme
   lock and dark-mode rules.

2. landing-page-design by Elaya (MIT)
   Upstream-Repo: https://github.com/elayadesign/ai-design-skills
   Upstream-Path: skills/landing-page-design
   Upstream-Commit: ded7efc
   Used: nested-radius formula, text wrapping, dead-link rule and the launch
   checklist.

3. impeccable by Paul Bakaus (Apache License 2.0)
   Upstream-Repo: https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
   Version: 4.1.1 (skill build), upstream HEAD 02523ae at adaptation
   Used: browser-surface theming, coloured-surface contrast, elevation and
   real-illustration rules from reference/craft-floor.md.
   Changes: rules paraphrased, merged with the sources above, and
   reorganised into page-craft.md sections. Licensed under the Apache
   License, Version 2.0; the full text is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt.

